# Privacy Policy – PopChat

**Effective Date:** 19 November 2026

PopChat respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how PopChat collects, uses, stores and protects your information when you use our mobile application.

## 1. Information We Collect

### Google Account Information
When you sign in using Google, we may collect:
- Google account ID
- Email address
- Display name
- Profile picture

We do not access your Gmail inbox, Google contacts or other Google services.

### Location Information
PopChat requests access to your device location to:
- Discover nearby POPs.
- Show relevant requests within your surrounding area.
- Help users connect with people nearby.

Location access is required for location-based features. You can manage location permissions through your device settings.

### User-Generated Information
We collect information you provide through the application, including:
- POP questions and descriptions.
- Messages sent in POP chats.
- Profile information.
- Chat participation and activity.

### Technical Information
We may collect basic technical information such as device details, application logs and crash reports to maintain and improve the service.

## 2. How We Use Your Information

We use collected information to:
- Authenticate users through Google Sign-In.
- Create and manage user accounts.
- Display nearby POP requests.
- Enable users to create and join POPs.
- Facilitate conversations and messaging.
- Maintain application security.
- Improve application performance.

## 3. Information Sharing

We do not sell users' personal information.

Certain information may be visible to other users when using PopChat. For example, your display name, profile picture, POP content and messages may be visible to participants in relevant POP conversations.

We may share necessary information with service providers responsible for hosting, authentication, database infrastructure and application operations.

## 4. Location Privacy

Location information is used to provide nearby discovery functionality. We do not use location information for unrelated advertising purposes.

Users can disable location permissions through their device settings, although some application features may stop working.

## 5. Data Storage and Security

We use reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect user information against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure or destruction.

However, no internet-based service can guarantee absolute security.

## 6. Data Retention and Account Deletion

We retain personal information only for as long as necessary to provide our services and meet applicable legal requirements.

Users may request account deletion by contacting our support team.

Upon verified deletion requests, we will delete or anonymize associated personal information, subject to applicable legal retention requirements.

## 7. Children's Privacy

PopChat is not intended for children under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13.

## 8. Third-Party Services

PopChat may use third-party services such as:
- Google Sign-In for authentication.
- Cloud hosting and database providers.
- Infrastructure and messaging services.

These services may process information in accordance with their respective privacy policies.

## 9. Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Updated versions will be published on this page with a revised effective date.

